{"seq":3,"slug":"long-duration-storage","title":"长时储能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/energy-storage-systems/long-duration-storage","wordCount":2369,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"长时储能\">长时储能</h1><p>锂电池储能站把功率铺满了 2024—2026 年的电网，但它们几乎都是 2—4 小时的「短跑选手」：太阳一落山放完电就空了。当一个省份的风光渗透率越过约 30%，电网真正缺的不再是「再多几小时」，而是能扛过连续阴天、无风夜、甚至跨季节的「长跑选手」。这就是长时储能（Long-Duration Energy Storage, LDES）要填的洞。</p>\n<p>美国能源部（DOE）把 LDES 定义为「能持续放电 10 小时及以上」的系统；加州公用事业委员会（CPUC）则把 8—12 小时归为长时、4 小时以下归为短时（见 <a href=\"https://www.energy.gov/oced/long-duration-energy-storage\">DOE OCED</a>）。本文按 DOE 口径讨论 10—100 小时这个区间里的主流技术、经济性与选型逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>长时储能不是某一种电池，而是一类「用低单位容量成本换取长放电时长」的技术集合。它和短时锂电的根本区别在于成本结构：锂电的功率成本（电芯、PCS）和能量成本（更多电芯）是绑在一起涨的，时长每加一倍价格几乎翻倍；而液流电池、压缩空气这类技术把「功率」和「能量」解耦——功率由电堆/膨胀机决定，能量只由电解液罐体或盐穴容积决定，加时长只需加便宜的储罐或挖更大的洞。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[长时储能 LDES&lt;br/&gt;放电时长 10-100h] --&gt; B[电化学&lt;br/&gt;液流电池]&#10;    A --&gt; C[机械&lt;br/&gt;压缩空气 CAES]&#10;    A --&gt; D[热储能&lt;br/&gt;熔盐 / 储热]&#10;    A --&gt; E[化学&lt;br/&gt;氢 / 氨]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[全钒液流&lt;br/&gt;最成熟]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[铁液流 / 铁空气&lt;br/&gt;低成本路线]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[盐穴 CAES&lt;br/&gt;选址依赖地质]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[配合光热&lt;br/&gt;或弃电制热]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[跨季节&lt;br/&gt;但效率最低]\">flowchart TD\n    A[长时储能 LDES&lt;br/&gt;放电时长 10-100h] --&gt; B[电化学&lt;br/&gt;液流电池]\n    A --&gt; C[机械&lt;br/&gt;压缩空气 CAES]\n    A --&gt; D[热储能&lt;br/&gt;熔盐 / 储热]\n    A --&gt; E[化学&lt;br/&gt;氢 / 氨]\n    B --&gt; B1[全钒液流&lt;br/&gt;最成熟]\n    B --&gt; B2[铁液流 / 铁空气&lt;br/&gt;低成本路线]\n    C --&gt; C1[盐穴 CAES&lt;br/&gt;选址依赖地质]\n    D --&gt; D1[配合光热&lt;br/&gt;或弃电制热]\n    E --&gt; E1[跨季节&lt;br/&gt;但效率最低]</pre><p>衡量长时储能优劣的核心指标是平准化储能成本（LCOS），即把全生命周期的资本、运维、充电与折旧摊到每度放出的电上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LCOS</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mfrac><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LCOS} = \\frac{C_{\\text{cap}} + \\sum_t \\frac{O_t + E_t}{(1+r)^t}}{\\sum_t \\frac{Q_t}{(1+r)^t}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LCOS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1329em;vertical-align:-1.3344em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7984em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1856em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9244em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8884em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3344em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{cap}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是初始投资，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 年运维，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是充电成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是年放电量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是折现率。DOE 的「长时储能攻关（Long Duration Storage Shot）」目标是把 LCOS 在 2030 年前降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>kWh</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.05/\\text{kWh}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kWh</span></span></span></span></span></span>（即 5 美分/度·循环），较当前水平下降约 90%（见 <a href=\"https://www.energy.gov/oced/long-duration-energy-storage\">DOE OCED</a>）。</p>\n<p>下表对比 2026 年几条主流技术路线的关键参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术路线</th>\n<th>典型放电时长</th>\n<th>往返效率</th>\n<th>循环寿命</th>\n<th>选址约束</th>\n<th>成熟度（2026）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全钒液流（VRFB）</td>\n<td>4—12 h</td>\n<td>65%—75%</td>\n<td>&gt;15000 次</td>\n<td>几乎无</td>\n<td>商业化最成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁液流 / 铁空气</td>\n<td>8—100 h</td>\n<td>铁空气约 40%—50%</td>\n<td>长</td>\n<td>几乎无</td>\n<td>早期商业化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩空气（CAES）</td>\n<td>4—10 h</td>\n<td>约 70%</td>\n<td>数十年</td>\n<td>强（需盐穴/洞穴）</td>\n<td>已有 300MW 级电站</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>熔盐 / 储热</td>\n<td>6—10 h+</td>\n<td>视耦合方式</td>\n<td>长</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>示范为主</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"全钒液流-长时储能的-商业化元年\">全钒液流：长时储能的「商业化元年」</h2><p>全钒液流电池（VRFB）在 2026 年被普遍视为最成熟的 LDES 技术。它的特殊之处在于正负极都用同一种钒元素的不同价态，电解液跨膜窜混也不会永久失效——这让它的循环寿命轻松超过 15000 次，且容量衰减极小，理论寿命与储罐同寿。安全性也是卖点：水基电解液不会热失控，没有锂电的起火风险，因此特别适合靠近负荷中心或社区的大容量场站。</p>\n<p>代价是能量密度低、初始投资高（钒价波动大），所以它的甜区是「时长 4—12 小时、要循环很多次、对安全敏感」的固定式场景，而不是追求体积紧凑的场合。</p>\n<p>2026 年的产业进展印证了它在加速。英国 <a href=\"https://www.energy-storage.news/\">Invinity Energy Systems</a> 报告称其系统成本下降约 36%，在手项目包括与台湾永续能源的 14 MWh 试点、与美国能源部清洁能源示范办公室（OCED）合作的 72 MWh 项目；欧洲最大的 VRFB 项目（英国东萨塞克斯 Copwood，20.7 MWh，配 2 MW 光伏）预计 2026 年底投运（见 <a href=\"https://www.energy-storage.news/\">Energy-Storage.News</a>）。中国市场同样将 2024—2026 视为「液流电池商业化加速」的窗口（见 <a href=\"https://chuneng.ofweek.com/news/2025-03/ART-180225-8420-30659315.html\">OFweek 储能网行业报告</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"铁基路线-把单位成本压到地板\">铁基路线：把单位成本压到地板</h2><p>如果说全钒液流追求寿命与安全，铁基路线追求的就是极致便宜——用地壳里最廉价、最丰富的铁，去换 100 小时级别的超长时储能。</p>\n<p>最受关注的是 Form Energy 的铁空气电池（iron-air）。它的化学本质就是「可控生锈」：放电时铁被氧化成铁锈，充电时再还原回铁。原料近乎免费，所以 Form Energy 的目标是把系统能量成本压到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>kWh</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20/\\text{kWh}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kWh</span></span></span></span></span></span>、放电时长达 100 小时——这是锂电难以企及的量级。代价是往返效率低（铁空气约 40%—50%），所以它定位的是「一年用不了几十次、但每次要扛过整周阴天」的稀缺备份，而非日内套利。</p>\n<p>2026 年的落地节点：Form Energy 与佐治亚电力（Georgia Power）的首个公用事业级项目（1 MW / 100 MWh）已投运，西弗吉尼亚州 7.6 亿美元工厂瞄准 2026 年量产，到 2028 年项目储备达 85 GWh（见 <a href=\"https://energy-solutions.co/articles/sub/aqueous-iron-air-batteries-long-duration-storage\">Energy Solutions Intelligence</a>、<a href=\"https://energydigital.com/news/iron-air-batteries-transforming-renewable-energy-storage\">Energy Digital</a>）。另一家 ESS Inc. 的模块化铁液流电池提供 8—22 小时放电，并称有望在 2030 年达到 DOE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>kWh</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.05/\\text{kWh}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kWh</span></span></span></span></span></span> 目标（见 <a href=\"https://www.energy-storage.news/non-lithium-players-eos-and-ess-lean-on-future-of-us-ldes-deployment-in-q1-2026-financials/\">Energy-Storage.News</a>）。</p>\n<p>铁基与全钒的取舍可以这样判断：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[选长时电化学路线?] --&gt; B{放电时长需求}&#10;    B --&gt;|4-12h 日内调节&lt;br/&gt;循环频繁| C[全钒液流&lt;br/&gt;寿命长 安全]&#10;    B --&gt;|24-100h 多日备份&lt;br/&gt;循环稀疏| D[铁空气&lt;br/&gt;单位成本最低]&#10;    C --&gt; E{对成本极度敏感?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[考虑铁液流&lt;br/&gt;8-22h 折中]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| C\">graph TD\n    A[选长时电化学路线?] --&gt; B{放电时长需求}\n    B --&gt;|4-12h 日内调节&lt;br/&gt;循环频繁| C[全钒液流&lt;br/&gt;寿命长 安全]\n    B --&gt;|24-100h 多日备份&lt;br/&gt;循环稀疏| D[铁空气&lt;br/&gt;单位成本最低]\n    C --&gt; E{对成本极度敏感?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[考虑铁液流&lt;br/&gt;8-22h 折中]\n    E --&gt;|否| C</pre><h2 id=\"压缩空气-把电网搬进盐穴\">压缩空气：把电网搬进盐穴</h2><p>压缩空气储能（CAES）是另一条完全不同的物理路线——它不存电子，而是用富余电力把空气压进地下盐穴、洞穴或储罐，需要时释放高压空气驱动膨胀机发电。它的能量本质是热力学的：压缩升温、膨胀降温，先进绝热 CAES（A-CAES）会把压缩产生的热单独存下来、放电时回灌，从而把往返效率从老式 CAES 的不到 50% 提到 70% 左右。</p>\n<p>中国在这条路线上跑在前面。2025 年 1 月，位于湖北应城的世界首座 300 MW 级压缩空气储能电站全面投运，容量 300 MW / 1500 MWh，利用废弃盐矿，建设周期约两年，总投资约 19.5 亿元人民币，额定设计效率 72.1%，可连续放电约 6 小时（见 <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2025/01/10/worlds-largest-compressed-air-energy-storage-facility-commences-full-operation-in-china/\">pv-magazine</a>、<a href=\"https://www.globaltimes.cn/page/202501/1326611.shtml\">Global Times</a>）。加拿大 Hydrostor 则用「压缩空气推水上坡」的水柱配重思路实现先进 CAES，称效率约 65%（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hydrostor\">Hydrostor / Wikipedia</a>）。</p>\n<p>CAES 的死穴是选址：它强依赖合适的地下盐穴或岩洞，不能随处建——这与液流电池「哪都能放」形成鲜明对比。但一旦地质条件满足，它的容量成本极低、寿命以数十年计，是大规模、长寿命场景的有力竞争者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条路线如何分工-场景化选型\">三条路线如何分工：场景化选型</h2><p>到 2026 年，长时储能不再是「谁取代谁」的单选题，而是按场景分工的拼图。从中国 2024 年的新增装机结构就能看出多元化格局：长时储能新增并网约 1.3 GW / 8.1 GWh，其中压缩空气同比增超 70 倍达 711 MW（容量占比约 53%）、液流电池增长超 10 倍达 368 MW（约 28%）、熔盐储能增长 250% 达 250 MW（约 19%）（见 <a href=\"https://www.china5e.com/news/news-1175277-1.html\">china5e 中国能源网</a>）。</p>\n<p>全球趋势同样指向爆发：LDES 累计装机预计从 2024 年的 2.4 GW 增长到 2030 年的 18.5 GW，项目数从 145 个增至 850 个以上（见 <a href=\"https://www.patsnap.com/resources/blog/articles/energy-storage-2026-iron-air-vanadium-flow-caes/\">PatSnap LDES 2026 报告</a>）。</p>\n<p>选型时可以按「时长 × 频次 × 选址」三轴来判断：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>时长需求</th>\n<th>循环频次</th>\n<th>推荐路线</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日内峰谷套利</td>\n<td>4—8 h</td>\n<td>每天</td>\n<td>全钒液流 / 短时锂电</td>\n<td>循环多、寿命要求高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多日阴雨备份</td>\n<td>24—100 h</td>\n<td>每年数十次</td>\n<td>铁空气</td>\n<td>单位容量成本最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域大规模调峰</td>\n<td>6—10 h</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>盐穴 CAES</td>\n<td>容量成本低、寿命长（需地质）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配光热/弃电消纳</td>\n<td>6 h+</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>熔盐 / 储热</td>\n<td>与热源天然耦合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>需要警惕的常见误区是「唯效率论」：铁空气往返效率只有 40%—50%，单看效率很难看，但当它放电时长是锂电的 25 倍、单位容量成本是其几分之一时，整体 LCOS 反而可能更低。这正是长时储能与短时储能在评价逻辑上的根本分野——短时储能比的是「每度电进出损耗多少」，长时储能比的是「为了那些少数关键时刻，每年备份的成本是多少」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>长时储能（LDES）按 DOE 口径指放电 ≥10 小时的系统，目标是填补高比例新能源下「连续阴天/无风夜/跨季节」的缺口，而非锂电擅长的日内 2—4 小时调节。</li>\n<li>其经济性核心是成本解耦：功率与能量分离，加时长只需加便宜的储罐或盐穴容积，因此用 LCOS 而非往返效率来评判；DOE 攻关目标为 2030 年 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>kWh</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.05/\\text{kWh}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kWh</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>全钒液流是 2026 年最成熟的路线，寿命 &gt;15000 次且安全，甜区是 4—12 小时、循环频繁的固定式场景（Invinity 成本降约 36%）。</li>\n<li>铁基路线追求极致低成本：Form Energy 铁空气瞄准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>kWh</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20/\\text{kWh}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kWh</span></span></span></span></span></span>、100 小时，定位多日稀疏备份，已与佐治亚电力投运 1 MW/100 MWh。</li>\n<li>压缩空气走机械/热力学路线，中国湖北应城 300 MW/1500 MWh 电站 2025 年投运、效率 72.1%，优势是容量成本与寿命，软肋是强选址约束。</li>\n<li>2026 年的产业现实是多元分工而非单一赢家：按「时长 × 频次 × 选址」三轴选型，全球 LDES 装机预计 2030 年达 18.5 GW。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"长时储能","id":"长时储能"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"全钒液流：长时储能的「商业化元年」","id":"全钒液流-长时储能的-商业化元年"},{"level":2,"text":"铁基路线：把单位成本压到地板","id":"铁基路线-把单位成本压到地板"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩空气：把电网搬进盐穴","id":"压缩空气-把电网搬进盐穴"},{"level":2,"text":"三条路线如何分工：场景化选型","id":"三条路线如何分工-场景化选型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电池储能系统 BESS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/energy-storage-systems/battery-storage-systems-bess"},"next":{"title":"波动性可再生能源并网","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration/variable-renewable-integration"}}